  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "lagchhe",
      "bn": "লাগছে",
      "tr": "lagchhe",
      "en": "feel (right now)",
      "alt": [
        "feels",
        "am feeling",
        "is feeling",
        "are feeling"
      ],
      "pos": "verb",
      "lesson": "u14-l01",
      "notes": "Present continuous of লাগা 'feel'. The feeler goes in the -র form and the verb never changes: আমার / তোমার / আপনার ভালো লাগছে. ভালো লাগে (U4) is a habit ('I like it'); লাগছে is how you feel now."
    },
